 "suite": {
  "name": "release-tp3",
  "version": 2,
  "description": "Release measurement for three nodes (8 streams, 512K context), about 61 minutes a build: model behaviour on all 256 prompts at eight streams, the engine grid up to eight requests, eight and four streams in a closed loop, Poisson arrivals at 0.42 requests/s (about 80% of eight streams' rate on r6h) with goodput under a 2 s time to first token and 100 ms per output token, decode stalls while a cold 131K prompt prefills at three depths of the eight slots (3 and 6 streams, with short probes sent 2-14 s into it; 7 streams, which fills every slot during the prefill), and real-text prefill from 32K to 500K. Its grid needs the dev-mode collective RPC.",
